WEBVTT

1
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:39.000
Nathan B.: Launch moves to Tuesday 27 October. The billing estimate came in at 6 engineering days.

2
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:24.000
Nathan B.: So we launch on 27 October with monthly plans only. Annual follows once legal signs off the wording.

3
00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:57.000
Daniel K.: For the pricing page: per-practitioner first, trial second, that's the order.

4
00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:27.000
Daniel K.: Three of three clinic owners read the price per practitioner first.

5
00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:44.000
Nathan B.: Then the table layout wins.

6
00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:10.000
Nathan B.: I'll make the call on annual once legal answers.

7
00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:29.000
Emma C.: 340 clinics are on the self-serve waitlist. I'll have the launch email ready by Friday for review.

8
00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:17.000
Nathan B.: You own launch-day comms, and I own the go/no-go on 26 October.

9
00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:20.000
Emma C.: Works for me.

10
00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:08.000
Emma C.: What happens to clinics mid-trial on the old plan? Billing needs an answer before 26 October.
